\section{The reflection}
\label{ViewReflection}

The reflections are one list behind the reflect task, by all students
(\cref{Reviews}).
We keep the student's, by user id, and turn their Quill bodies into text
with the reviews chapter's [[plain_text]].

<<constants>>=
REFLECTION_TITLE = "Reflection"
<<functions>>=
def reflection_section(activity, users):
    """Return the `Section` of the reflection of `users`."""
    task = activity.task[review_module.REFLECT_TASK]
    reflections = [reflection for reflection in activity.fbf.get(
                       related_link(task, "reflections")).resources
                   if related_id(reflection, "user") in users]
    texts = [review_module.plain_text(attribute(r, "body")).strip()
             for r in reflections]
    return Section(REFLECTION_TITLE,
                   "\n\n".join(text for text in texts if text) or "None.")
@

